# The windmill's parts: the post stands on the root, the sails turn about their hub (z is the axis they turn on).
joint post - 0 0 0
joint sails post 0 1.5 -0.15
# Animation 0, which static scenery plays: one turn of the sails every two seconds (four keys, a quarter each).
anim 0 turn
key 500
sails rot 0 0 0
key 500
sails rot 0 0 1024
key 500
sails rot 0 0 2048
key 500
sails rot 0 0 3072
